sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    box Frontend
        participant Web as Web App
    end
    box Backend
        participant Auth as Auth API
        participant DB as PostgreSQL
        participant Session as Session Store
    end

    Note over User,Web: Credentials travel over HTTPS
    User->>Web: Submit credentials
    Web->>Auth: POST /login
    activate Auth
    Auth->>+DB: Find account
    DB-->>-Auth: Account and password hash
    Auth->>Auth: Verify password
    deactivate Auth

    alt Password valid
        activate Auth
        Note right of Auth: Create a secure session
        loop Retry session write (up to 2 attempts)
            Auth->>+Session: Save session
            Session-->>-Auth: Session persisted
        end
        opt Remember this device
            Auth->>+DB: Save trusted device
            DB-->>-Auth: Device saved
        end
        deactivate Auth
        Auth-->>Web: 200 OK + session cookie
        Web-->>User: Show dashboard
    else Password incorrect
        Note over Web,Auth: Authentication failed — no session created
        Auth-->>Web: 401 Unauthorized
        Web-->>User: Show password error
    end
